                        <p><strong>Mobile Phones:</strong></p>

<ul class="disclaimers-list">

  <li>
    <strong>Mobile Repair Price Update:</strong> 
    Prices are current as of May 2026, and Samsung reserves the right to update them at any time.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Qatar, Kuwait, Oman and Bahrain:</strong> 
    Pages are currently under development. Please coordinate with Samsung Authorized Service Centers for final pricing post inspection.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Applicable Models:</strong> 
    Prices are valid for models purchased from authorized outlets in the UAE, Oman, Qatar, Bahrain, and Kuwait (the "Territory").
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Service Centers:</strong> 
    Authorized service centers in the UAE, Qatar, Kuwait, Bahrain, and Oman are eligible for these prices.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Fault Description and Pricing:</strong> 
    Contact your nearest Samsung authorized service center for detailed fault descriptions and final pricing.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Service Center Locator:</strong> 
    Use the toll-free number or visit 
    <a href="https://www.samsung.com/ae/support/service-center/" target="_blank">
      https://www.samsung.com/ae/support/service-center/
    </a> 
    for the nearest service center.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Request your repair now via Galaxy Expert Care</strong> 
    and get your mobile collected and dropped back to you repaired.
    <a href="https://www.samsung.com/ae/galaxy-expert-care/" target="_blank">
      https://www.samsung.com/ae/galaxy-expert-care/
    </a>
  </li>

</ul>
<br>
                        <p><strong>Consumer Electronics:</strong></p>
<ul class="disclaimers-list">
  <li><strong>Repair Price Update:</strong> Prices valid as of August 2025; subject to change.</li>
  <li><strong>Price Range:</strong> Includes panel repair cost only; labor, visit charges, and VAT added separately.</li>
  <li><strong>Turnaround Time (TAT):</strong> Estimated; varies based on product condition.</li>
  <li><strong>Price Variation:</strong> May differ based on the repair provider.</li>
  <li><strong>TV Repair Prices:</strong> Based on TV sizes; final prices determined post-technician inspection.
  <ul>
  <li>


    <strong>Service Center:</strong> Use the toll-free number or visit 
    <a href="https://www.samsung.com/ae/support/service-center/" target="_blank">
      https://www.samsung.com/ae/support/service-center/
    </a> for the nearest service center.
    </ul>
  </li>
   </li>
  <li><strong>Inspection Fees:</strong> Applied for all in-home visits by Samsung Authorized Service Partners.</li>
  <li><strong>Warranty Repairs:</strong> Up to seven (7) days; may take longer due to unforeseen events or complexities.</li>
  <li><strong>Screen Repair:</strong> Panel repair service available for TVs.</li>
</ul>

                        </ul>
                        <p><br><br><strong>Monitors: </strong></p>
<ul class="disclaimers-list">
